      "name": "Malware Infection",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [
        "concentrate"
      ],
      "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The digital ghost attempts to infect an item with the tech trait being held or used by a creature within 30 feet. The bearer can attempt a DC 21 Will Saving Throw save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The item is unaffected, and the digital ghost can't use Malware Infection for 1 week.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The item is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The item becomes glitching 2.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The item becomes glitching 2, and an offline digital ghost based on the bearer is created on the device in 2d4 days.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
